ght, die and emerge stronger accompanied by the Spirits of those who have fallen.</li></ul><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1786010/extras/d6b29a0f94ed9f4769d51c57e2c90a33.poster.avif?t=1711714084\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1786010/extras/d6b29a0f94ed9f4769d51c57e2c90a33.webm?t=1711714084\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1786010/extras/d6b29a0f94ed9f4769d51c57e2c90a33.mp4?t=1711714084\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>Personality-based Skill System</strong>: Learn new skills and abilities based on the personality you choose for your Vazzard, allowing for varied and strategic gameplay approaches.</li></ul><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1786010/extras/1d34575a8fa4cc81249ccaa5328ca764.poster.avif?t=1711714084\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1786010/extras/1d34575a8fa4cc81249ccaa5328ca764.webm?t=1711714084\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1786010/extras/1d34575a8fa4cc81249ccaa5328ca764.mp4?t=1711714084\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>Choose your own path</strong>: Unpredictable events will spice up your journey, introducing unexpected encounters, opportunities, and dangers. Choose your path wisely, as your choices will profoundly impact the unfolding story.</li></ul><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1786010/extras/4732c064e29f268b0992809aa