    "short_description": "Aetheris is a tactical RPG with challenging turn-based battles set in an immersive and vibrant environment. Make the right choices and find the best strategy to survive in the unforgiving Wilderness. Journey alone or as a party of four\u2014the adventure awaits!",
    "supported_languages": "English, French, Traditional Chinese, Simplified Chinese",
    "reviews": "\u201cAETHERIS is a very thoughtful RPG where every move you make has a purpose. Nothing feels wasted here, and what you do and what you risk will affect each and every fight you go through. If you love strategy and tabletop games, this game is for you.\u201d<br>9/10 \u2013 GameGrin<br>",
